    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now have Security Center send you email notifications when an Azure Government alert is generated.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To set up your subscriptions, see&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/security-center/security-center-provide-security-contact-details#email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Set up email notifications for alerts</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now have Security Center send you email notifications when an Azure Government alert is generated.\n\nTo set up your subscriptions, see Set up email notifications for alerts ."
  },
